[enum_2859]
inputtype=int
outputtype=string
val=1,The most valuable player.
val=2,Didn't contribute at all.
val=3,Most melee damage dealt.
val=4,Most ranged damage dealt.
val=5,Most magic damage dealt.
val=6,Dealt the killing blow to a boss while on less than 10 life points.
val=7,Dealt the least damage.
val=8,Died eight times. No more, no less.
val=9,Experienced an unfortunate end by fire.
val=10,Got killed by a chisel.
val=11,Victim of an unfortunate construction disaster.
val=12,Lost a fight with a fishing rod.
val=13,Most damage taken.
val=14,Didn't die at all.
val=15,Exactly what it says on the tin.
val=16,Killed a boss with Vengeance.
val=17,Killed a boss with Retribution.
val=18,Completed the greatest variety of tasks.
val=19,Stole the most killing blows.
val=20,Dealt out damage, but never with weapons or spells.
val=21,Gathered the most resources.
val=22,Vanquished a superior foe.
val=23,Fell victim to a vastly inferior foe.
val=24,Failed the most skill tasks.
val=25,The only player to deal damage, but not take any.
val=26,Wasted the most food by over-eating.
val=27,Cooked the most life points' worth of food.
val=28,Cast non-combat spells but, otherwise, dealt no damage.
val=29,Attempted a number of skill tasks but didn't complete a single one.
val=30,Burned the most food.
val=31,Wasted the most money through alchemy spells.
val=32,Alch-ed the last pickaxe.
val=33,Did nothing to deserve any titles...except this one.
val=34,Death by Bovimastyx. They never attack the same place twice; they remember...
val=35,Carried useful equipment from start to finish.
val=36,Like a true pro, you only ate heim crabs in the dungeon.
val=37,You teleported to the group gatestone, but died shortly after.
val=38,You healed your team mates for the most total life points.
val=39,Laid at least 10 bones to rest on an altar.
val=40,Most people teleport away from their current location. Not you.
val=41,You tried to save someone from death by using a heim crab, but it was too late.
val=42,Entered a boss room while the rest of your party were in the start room.
val=43,Used a gatestone to escape the boss room on low health.
val=44,You adopted Mod_Reece's stubborn nature by killing a boss while close to death, but with plenty of food left.
val=45,You matched Mod_Trick's epic performance by getting 'Nothing Special' three times in a row.
val=46,You developed Mod_Liono's passion for enslaving small creatures.
val=47,You displayed Mod_Mark's persistence by exhausting every resource on the critical path.
val=48,You gained Mod_Hulme's green fingers by harvesting at least 25 potatoes...but doing the least damage.
val=49,You kept up with Mod_Chris_L, blitzing through the entire dungeon and entering new rooms without fear.
val=50,You equalled Mod_Benny's love of carnage by doing plenty of damage with melee, ranged and magic.
defaultstring=

