val=3932343,Basic decorative legs: Wearing platebody, platelegs and shield together gives +10% damage against players in the arena.
val=3932348,Basic decorative shield: Wearing platebody, platelegs and shield together gives +10% damage against players in the arena.
val=3932353,Basic decorative sword: Not required for the set bonus.
val=3932358,Detailed decorative helm: Not required for the set bonus.
val=3932363,Detailed decorative body: Wearing platebody, platelegs and shield together gives +15% damage against players and +10% damage against barricades and ballistas.
val=3932368,Detailed decorative legs: Wearing platebody, platelegs and shield together gives +15% damage against players and +10% damage against barricades and ballistas.
val=3932373,Detailed decorative shield: Wearing platebody, platelegs and shield together gives +15% damage against players and +10% damage against barricades and ballistas.
val=3932378,Detailed decorative sword: Not required for the set bonus.
val=3932323,Intricate decorative helm: Not required for the set bonus.
val=3932324,Intricate decorative body: Wearing platebody, platelegs and shield together gives +20% damage against players, +10% damage against barricades and ballistas, and immunity to catapult damage.
val=3932325,Intricate decorative legs: Wearing platebody, platelegs and shield together gives +20% damage against players, +10% damage against barricades and ballistas, and immunity to catapult damage.
val=3932326,Intricate decorative shield: Wearing platebody, platelegs and shield together gives +20% damage against players, +10% damage against barricades and ballistas, and immunity to catapult damage.
val=3932327,Intricate decorative sword: Not required for the set bonus.
val=3932328,Profound decorative helm: Not required for the set bonus.
val=3932329,Profound decorative body: Wearing platebody, platelegs and shield together gives +25% damage against players, +10% damage against barricades and ballistas, and immunity to catapult and ballista damage.
val=3932330,Profound decorative legs: Wearing platebody, platelegs and shield together gives +25% damage against players, +10% damage against barricades and ballistas, and immunity to catapult and ballista damage.
val=3932331,Profound decorative shield: Wearing platebody, platelegs and shield together gives +25% damage against players, +10% damage against barricades and ballistas, and immunity to catapult and ballista damage.
val=3932332,Profound decorative sword: Not required for the set bonus.
val=3932207,Ballista base: One of four parts needed to set up a ballista inside the arena.
val=3932208,Ballista bolt stack: One of four parts needed to set up the ballista inside the arena.
val=3932209,Ballista bow: One of four parts needed to set up the ballista inside the arena.
val=3932214,Ballista chamber: One of four parts needed to set up the ballista inside the arena.
val=3932215,Ballista ammo: Ammo fired by the ballista inside the arena.
val=3932216,Melee potion set: Set containing boosts to Attack, Strength, Defence and run energy. Can only be used inside the arena.
val=3932217,Ranged potion set: Set containing boosts to Ranged, Defence and run energy. Can only be used inside the arena.
val=3932218,Magic potion set: Set containing boosts to Magic, Defence and run energy. Can only be used inside the arena.
val=3932253,Saradomin team cape: A basic Saradomin team cape.
val=3932258,Zamorak team cape: A basic Zamorak team cape.
val=3932263,Saradomin team hood: A basic Saradomin team hood.
val=3932268,Zamorak team hood: A basic Zamorak team hood.
val=3932269,Castle Wars flag cape: For showing off achievement of most flag captures in a match.
val=3932270,Castle Wars kills cape: For showing off achievement of most kills in a match.
val=3932271,Castle Wars hobbyist cape: For showing off achievement of 500 games of Castle Wars.
val=3932272,Castle Wars enthusiast cape: For showing off achievement of 1,000 games of Castle Wars.
val=3932273,Castle Wars professional cape: For showing off achievement of 5,000 games of Castle Wars.
val=3932274,Guthix halo: Reduces the drain rate of various prayers. 
val=3932275,Saradomin halo: Reduces the drain rate of various prayers.
val=3932276,Zamorak halo: Reduces the drain rate of various prayers.
val=3932277,Faithful shield: A shield with a great Prayer bonus.
val=3932278,Manual: details the rules of Castle Wars.
